{"title":"2003 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The circumference of a circle is arbitrarily divided into four arcs. The midpoints of the arcs are connected by segments. Show that two of these segments are perpendicular.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/7/0a70ef3ff6592247a7bb65ba8bb54d724b112890.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A, B, C, D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"83\" height=\"18\" /> in that order be the four points that divide the circle into four arcs.  Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/c/cfcbfe9318c37d201eabbfcc7fce9d614ad803d8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F, G, H, J$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"78\" height=\"16\" /> be the midpoints of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/d/acde362461318ca4c4a90fecb1a3f671c36912c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overarc{AB}, \\overarc{BC}, \\overarc{CD}, \\overarc{DA}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"123\" height=\"17\" /> respectively, and let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/4/6a47ca0fe7cb276abc022af6ac88ddae1a9d6894.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> be the intersection of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/f/fffb105232a8a0e6307866e5d52ccb9e6db45c33.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$FH$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"33\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/a/7fab1b594cd5ac9c6b0aaeff14173b891d6e48ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$GJ$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" />.  Additionally, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/5/d25663310df755edeee8db5f7b74a4573ef2e6e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\overarc{AB}, b = \\overarc{BC}, c = \\overarc{CD},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"191\" height=\"24\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/f/c4f9b7b31474c9937d2dd929bc378c0d198681ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d = \\overarc{DA}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"58\" height=\"21\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nNote that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/0/dc00e305fa5d757424a3fde8cde4a914f8bf7548.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b+c+d = 360^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"158\" height=\"14\" />.  Additionally, from the definition of midpoint, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/f/50f37a96b0ada055fd8de91678af0e5d5c60f636.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$FB = \\tfrac{a}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"62\" height=\"19\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/8/27876cf71451711e1e4880afa7f21b2bbf12c8b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BG = \\tfrac{b}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"62\" height=\"21\" />.  Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/0/be02aa3b9458334e69387f227c91c44c6fca25d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$FG = \\tfrac{a+b}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"78\" height=\"21\" />.  Likewise, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/1743187c4e64086e73c1d7c0f10c859c8ae27c51.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$HD = \\tfrac{c}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"65\" height=\"19\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/c/bcc893ca6bc4802c9699527c503a98591ac59287.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DJ = \\tfrac{d}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"60\" height=\"21\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/1/9d1636a120323c3168135dc868740adfa969442e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$HJ = \\tfrac{c+d}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"78\" height=\"21\" />.  Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/a/85ac4fe40cc877379c3c94ea6fd0593e7245ead6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle FXG = \\tfrac{a+b+c+d}{2} = \\tfrac{180}{2} = 90^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"239\" height=\"21\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/a/8fa222af49b6e997a247bf4f239091a93312e033.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$FH \\perp GJ$\" width=\"81\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Pan_African_MO\" title=\"2003 Pan African MO\">2003 Pan African MO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Pan_African_MO_Problems\" title=\"2003 Pan African MO Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2003 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2003 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2003 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2003 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2003 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2003 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2003 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Pan_African_MO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"Pan African MO Problems and Solutions\"> All Pan African MO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017202615\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.018 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.032 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 120/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 962/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 44/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3180/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.635      1 Template:Pan_African_MO_box\n100.00%    6.635      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:17997:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017202615 and revision id 115765. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}